            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Berkshire Hathaway basics: 5 post\u2013Warren Buffett questions to ask",
            "description": "<p>Berkshire Hathaway (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BRK-B\">BRK-B</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BRK-A\">BRK-A</a>) CEO Warren Buffett is set to pass over the chief executive reins to his successor, Greg Abel, on Jan. 1, 2026. Buffett will remain on the company's board as chairman.</p>\n<p>Yahoo Finance Markets and Data Editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/jared-blikre/\">Jared Blikre</a>, who also hosts Yahoo Finance's <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/stocks-in-translation/\">Stocks in Translation podcast</a>, breaks down everything investors need to know about the company and what to keep an eye on with Abel at the helm next year.</p>\n<p>Catch more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/stocks-in-translation/\">Stocks in Translation</a>, with new episodes every Tuesday and Thursday.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
